; Bounded native transactions; callers serialize consumption with Forbid.
MODULE INPUTCAPTURE
PUBLIC EXTERNAL LONGCARD FUNC Take()
PUBLIC EXTERNAL PROC ResetInput()
PUBLIC EXTERNAL PROC Discard(LONGCARD tag)
PUBLIC EXTERNAL PROC Publish(LONGCARD tag)
PUBLIC EXTERNAL LONGCARD FUNC TakeBreak()
PUBLIC EXTERNAL PROC PointerPublish(LONGCARD tag)
PUBLIC EXTERNAL PROC PointerDiscard(LONGCARD tag)
PUBLIC EXTERNAL CARD FUNC PointerTake(BYTE POINTER sample)
ENDMODULE
